{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix' data-target='computer\/os\/nix' data-title='*Nix'>\r\n\t\t\t*Nix\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/sh' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/sh' data-title='Sh'>\r\n\t\t\tSh\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Shell if, elif, and else syntax, with numerical and string comparison operators.","label":"If else","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/sh\/function","label":"Function","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/sh\/function"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/sh\/include","label":"Include","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/sh\/include"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tShell <code class='inline'>if<\/code> tests a condition in <code class='inline'>[ ]<\/code>. Spaces inside the brackets are required.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>if [ &lt;condition&gt; ]\n        then\n        ..\nelif\n        then\n        ..\nelse\nfi<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>elif<\/code> is else-if. <code class='inline'>else<\/code> has no <code class='inline'>then<\/code>. The block ends with <code class='inline'>fi<\/code>.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Condition<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>\"$var\" == \"value\"<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tOn Ubuntu use <code class='inline'>=<\/code> instead of <code class='inline'>==<\/code>.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Numerical<\/h2>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>-eq<\/code><\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>-ne<\/code><\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>-gt<\/code><\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>-lt<\/code><\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>-le<\/code><\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>-ge<\/code><\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<h2>String<\/h2>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>=<\/code><\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>!=<\/code><\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>&lt;<\/code> before alphabetically<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>&gt;<\/code> after alphabetically<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/sh\/if_else\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/sh\/if_else\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/sh\/function' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/sh\/function' data-title='Function' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Function<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next